                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of many marine amoeboid protozoa, of subclass Radiolaria, having filamentous pseudopodia; they have intricate silica skeletons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b21bc9d-bfeb-47e7-8625-381d5f53f6d2",
                                                "sense_id": "ed00aab0-b552-37f4-aa3c-ae23ae1de472",
                                                "text": "Water wells inkblack in the streets repeating the polelamps in glozy rosettes that dish and slide in the wash like radiolarians pale with phosphorous on a midnight sea."
